    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Workflow 1: Lead Intake\n\nPurpose: Captures new client inquiries and routes them based on their status in the pipeline.\n\nLogic:\n\nClient submits intake form (name, email, phone, services wanted)\nSystem checks if this email already exists in the Clients table\n\nBranch A — No match found:\n→ New lead, create fresh record, Status = \"New Lead,\" send welcome email\n\nBranch B1 — Match found, Status = \"Onboarded\":\n→ Returning client starting a new engagement, create a NEW record (fresh project), but reuse their existing Drive Folder ID, send \"welcome back\" email\n\nBranch B2 — Match found, Status = \"New Lead\" or \"Booked\":\n→ Still mid-pipeline, update existing record, replace Services Requested with latest selection, send \"request updated\" email\n\nEvery branch logs to the Activity Log table.\n\nDepends on: Airtable (Clients + Activity Log tables), Gmail, Cal.com booking link\n\nFeeds into: Workflow 2 (fires once client books via the link in this email)",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 576,
        "color": 2
      },
